n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Save-Big-on-Real-Estate-Best-Property-Deals!---Erie-County---Pennsylvania-Tax-Deed-Sale\">Save Big on Real Estate Best Property Deals! &#8211; Erie County &#8211; Pennsylvania Tax Deed Sale</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Discover incredible deals at Erie County, Pennsylvania, tax sales, where you can find properties available for 40-90% off market value. The tax sale process starts with the Upset Sale at the end of September, held at the <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/xX8Q8XWq81fW6VKy9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">H.O. Hirt Auditorium</mark></a>, located in the Blasco Library, Erie.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Prepare-for-the-Sale\">Steps to Prepare for the Sale</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Register as a Bidder</strong>: Complete and notarize the &#8220;Affidavit of Bidder&#8221; form available from August.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Review Property Listings</strong>: Check listings online or at the <a href=\"https://eriecountypa.gov/departments/tax-claim-and-revenue/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax Claim</mark></a> Office.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Attend the Sale</strong>: Be present at the <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/xX8Q8XWq81fW6VKy9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">H.O. Hirt Auditorium</mark></a> on the sale day.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Complete Payment</strong>: Pay at the Tax Claim Bureau’s office by 3:30 p.m. on the day of the sale.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Additional-Sales\">Additional Sales</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Judicial Sale</strong>: For properties not sold in the Upset Sale, Typically scheduled for December</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Repository Sale</strong>: Unsold properties from previous sales are available for bids starting at $250.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Erie-County-Pennsylvania-Bicentennial-Tower.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Erie-County-Pennsylvania-Bicentennial-Tower-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Erie-County-Pennsylvania-Bicentennial-Tower-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Erie-County-Pennsylvania-Bicentennial-Tower-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Erie-County-Pennsylvania-Bicentennial-Tower-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Erie-County-Pennsylvania-Bicentennial-Tower-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Erie-County-Pennsylvania-Bicentennial-Tower.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Erie-County-Pennsylvania-Bicentennial-Tower.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Erie-County-Pennsylvania-Bicentennial-Tower-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Erie-County-Pennsylvania-Bicentennial-Tower-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Erie-County-Pennsylvania-Bicentennial-Tower-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Erie-County-Pennsylvania-Bicentennial-Tower-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Erie-County-Pennsylvania-Bicentennial-Tower-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18338 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Erie County Pennsylvania Bicentennial Tower\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Contact-Information\">Contact Information</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Erie County Tax Claim Bureau</strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Address: <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/kST6PErdPsZDpJKU6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">140 W. Sixth Street, Room 110, Erie, PA 16501</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Phone: 814-451-6206</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fax: 814-451-7484</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Visit the <a href=\"https://eriecountypa.gov/property-tax-records/sales/tax-sales.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Erie County Tax Sales Information</mark></a> page​ for more details on the Erie County tax lien and tax deed sales.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions\">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What are the key dates for the Erie County tax sale?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: The Upset Sale is in September. The registration deadline is September.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How can I register to bid?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Complete the “Affidavit of Bidder” form, have it notarized, and submit it in person at the Tax Claim Bureau by the registration deadline. A $25 fee applies.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Where can I find the property listings?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: Listings are available online for free or at the Tax Claim Office for $0.25 per page starting August 30, 2024.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://eriecountypa.gov/departments/tax-claim-and-revenue/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Erie County Tax Claim and Revenue</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://eriecountypa.gov/property-tax-records/sales/tax-sales.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Erie County Property Tax Sales</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/pennsylvania-tax-deeds/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Seize Unbeatable Deals on Pennsylvania Properties with Tax Deed Auctions!</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-investing-overview/understanding-tax-deed-investing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Let’s talk about Tax Deeds and how you can profit from them!</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://youtu.be/